t is played using exoplayer with clearkey DRM.\r\n3. If only video stream is selected with no audio stream, video plays fully by acquiring all required keys from license server.\r\n4. But when audio stream is selected along with/without video stream, playback fails after 6 seconds.\r\n5. If I play google's key rotation sample hosted at [https://storage.googleapis.com/playerinfra/wv/sintel_3min_rotate.mpd](url), exoplayer plays both audio and video without any problem using widevine DRM.\r\nSo exoplayer supports key rotation and there is no exoplayer configuration issue.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Packager Command**:\r\n`packager \\\r\n  in=video_360p_h264-600k.mp4,stream=audio,output=audio.mp4,drm_label=AUDIO \\\r\n  in=video_360p_h264-600k.mp4,stream=video,output=h264_360p.mp4,drm_label=SD \\\r\n  in=video_480p_h264-1000k.mp4,stream=video,output=h264_480p.mp4,drm_label=SD \\\r\n  in=video_720p_h264-3000k.mp4,stream=video,output=h264_720p.mp4,drm_label=HD \\\r\n  in=video_1080p_h264-6000k.mp4,stream=video,output=h264_1080p.mp4,drm_label=HD \\\r\n  --enable_raw_key_encryption \\\r\n  --crypto_period_duration 120 \\\r\n  --keys label=AUDIO:key_id=279926496a7f5d25da69f2b3b2799a81:key=eee0f2b3b279926496a7f5d25da692f6,label=SD:key_id=279926496a7f5d25da69f2b3b2799a81:key=eee0f2b3b279926496a7f5d25da692f6,label=HD:key_id=279926496a7f5d25da69f2b3b2799a81:key=eee0f2b3b279926496a7f5d25da692f6 \\\r\n  --protection_systems Widevine,CommonSystem \\\r\n  --mpd_output h264.mpd`\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat is the expected result?\r\nBoth video along with audio streams should be played without any failure in exoplayer.\r\n\r\nWhat happens instead?\r\nOnly video stream plays fully. Audio stream playback fails after 6 seconds.\r\n\r\n<Please attach the input files or email to shaka-packager-issues@google.com.>\r\nShaka packager dash output files (Converted from xml to txt to attach here):\r\n[h264.txt](https://github.com/google/shaka-packager/files/5020570/h264.txt)\r\nMP4Box -diso output logs:\r\n[audio_info.txt](https://github.com/google/shaka-packager/files/5020592/audio_info.txt)\r\n[h264_360p_info.txt](https://github.com/google/shaka-packager/files/5020593/h264_360p_info.txt)\r\n\r\n\r\nReference content mentioned above from google:\r\n[https://storage.googleapis.com/playerinfra/wv/sintel_3min_rotate.mpd](url)\r\n\r\n<Please provide any additional information below.>\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\nWhen audio stream is selected and played in exoplayer and playback is seeked to any particular timestamp of the content (i.e. in my sample content, between 0 to 4 min 20 sec), corresponding key is acquired by exoplayer from license server correctly. But playback immediately fails.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/issues/811/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaka-project/shaka-packager/issues/811/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/671200538","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7716#issuecomment-671200538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7716","id":671200538,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3MTIwMDUzOA==","user":{"login":"mkcdot","id":68843485,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNDg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843485?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot","html_url":"https://github.com/mkcdot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkcdot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.git